75"}],"note":"情報の隔たりを重視する好奇心の理論。"}},{"id":"kb_447","title":"情報境界理論","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Sandra Petronio（参照文献の著者）","works":["Boundaries of Privacy: Dialectics of Disclosure (2002). "],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1353/book4588"}],"note":"Petronioのコミュニケーション・プライバシー管理を扱う原著。カードの「情報境界理論」という名称と正式な理論名の対応を区別します。","period":"2002年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_730","title":"所属欲求／Need to Belong","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Roy Baumeister / Mark Leary","period":"1995年","works":["The need to belong: Desire for interpersonal attachments as a fundamental human motivation (1995)"],"sources":[{"title":"代表研究（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/0033-2909.117.3.497"}],"note":"個人差と文化差はあるが、幅広い証拠が検討されている。"}},{"id":"kb_001","title":"初頭効果","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"S. E. Asch（参照文献の著者）","period":"1946年（参照文献）","works":["Forming impressions of personality. (1946). The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 41(3), 258-290"],"sources":[{"title":"文献情報・原文（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/h0055756"}],"note":"印象形成の代表的研究。記憶課題での初頭効果とは区別します。"}},{"id":"kb_744","title":"処理水準理論","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Fergus Craik / Robert Lockhart","period":"1972年","works":["Levels of processing: A framework for memory research (1972)"],"sources":[{"title":"代表研究（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0022-5371(72)80001-X"}],"note":"循環的な定義への批判があり、転移適合処理などで補われる。"}},{"id":"kb_219","title":"白熊効果","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Daniel M. Wegner / David J. Schneider / Samuel R. Carter / Teri L. White（参照文献の著者）","period":"1987年（参照文献）","works":["Paradoxical effects of thought suppression. (1987). Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 53(1), 5-13"],"sources":[{"title":"文献情報・原文（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/0022-3514.53.1.5"}],"note":"白熊を考えない課題などを用いた思考抑制の実験。"}},{"id":"kb_550","title":"新奇性効果","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Nico Bunzeck / Emrah Düzel（関連文献の著者）","works":["