006)"],"sources":[{"title":"代表研究（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01738.x"}],"note":"主に食行動の研究に基づき、領域間の一般化には確認が必要。"}},{"id":"kb_186","title":"小さな勝利","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Karl E. Weick（参照文献の著者）","period":"1984年（参照文献）","works":["Small wins: Redefining the scale of social problems. (1984). American Psychologist, 39(1), 40-49"],"sources":[{"title":"文献情報・原文（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/0003-066x.39.1.40"}],"note":"小さな達成を積み重ねる問題解決の論考。"}},{"id":"kb_531","title":"ツァイガルニク効果","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Bluma Zeigarnik（元の研究者） / Hellmuth Metz-Göckel（参照解説の著者）","works":["Das Behalten von erledigten und unerledigten Handlungen (2016). Gestalttheorie und kognitive Psychologie, 131-137"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-658-12666-7_16"}],"note":"Zeigarnikの実験とLewinの背景理論を紹介する学術書の章。参照解説の著者Metz-Göckelと元の研究者Zeigarnikを区別し、未完了の仕事が必ず記憶に残ると保証しません。","period":"2016年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_838","title":"ディドロ効果","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Grant McCracken","period":"1988年","works":["Culture and Consumption (1988)"],"note":"学術的には広い消費文化論に由来し、普遍的な法則として断定しない。"}},{"id":"kb_177","title":"デフォルト効果","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Eric J. Johnson / Daniel Goldstein（参照文献の著者）","period":"2003年（参照文献）","works":["Do Defaults Save Lives? (2003). Science, 302(5649), 1338-1339"],"sources":[{"title":"文献情報・原文（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1091721"}],"note":"デフォルト設定と選択を扱う研究。全分野で同じ効果を保証するものではありません。"}},{"id":"kb_198","title":"デリバレート・プラクティス","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"K. Anders Ericsson / Ralf T. Krampe / Clemens Tesch-Römer（参照文献の著者）","period":"1993年（参照文献）","works":["The role of deliberate practice in the acquisition of expert performance. (1993). Psychological Review, 100(3), 363-406"],"sources":[{"title":"文献情報・原文（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/0033-295x.100.3.363"}],"note":"熟達と意図的練習を扱う代表的論文。練習量だけで成果の全てが決まるという主張ではありません。"}},{"id":"kb_099","