status":"一部確認","attribution":"Marwell / Amesほか","period":"1979年以降","works":["Experiments on the provision of public goods (1979)"],"note":"実験の行動を現実社会へ一般化するときは制度差を考慮する。"}},{"id":"kb_792","title":"後方帰納法","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"John von Neumann / Oskar Morgensternほか","period":"1944年以降","works":["Theory of Games and Economic Behavior (1944)"],"note":"意思決定の一般的なバックキャスティングとは目的が異なる。"}},{"id":"kb_145","title":"固定パイ・バイアス","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Leigh Thompson / Reid Hastie（参照文献の著者）","works":["Social perception in negotiation (1990). Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes, 47(1), 98-123"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/0749-5978(90)90048-e"}],"note":"交渉で相手の利益をどう推測するかを検討した原著。","period":"1990年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_166","title":"コミットメント戦略","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Thomas C. Schelling（参照文献の著者）","works":["The Strategy of Conflict (1960) / Bargaining as Binding Oneself (1993)"],"sources":[{"title":"著者・出版社による原著・書誌情報","url":"https://garfield.library.upenn.edu/classics1993/A1993KH36300001.pdf"}],"note":"著者本人が原著とコミットメントの考え方を振り返った一次文献を参照。相手への拘束と自己への拘束を区別します。","period":"1960年（参照版）"}},{"id":"kb_798","title":"最後通牒ゲーム","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Werner Güth / Rolf Schmittberger / Bernd Schwarze","period":"1982年","works":["An experimental analysis of ultimatum bargaining (1982)"],"sources":[{"title":"代表研究（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/0167-2681(82)90011-7"}],"note":"結果は金額、匿名性、文化、実験設計で変わる。"}},{"id":"kb_568","title":"最適化の罠","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Barry Schwartz / Andrew Ward / John Monterosso / Sonja Lyubomirsky / Katherine White / Darrin R. Lehman（関連文献の著者）","works":["Maximizing versus satisficing: Happiness is a matter of choice. (2002). Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 83(5), 1178-1197"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/0022-3514.83.5.1178"}],"note":"最大化と満足化の研究を関連文献として参照。「最適化の罠」は実践的