 2(1), 71-87"],"sources":[{"title":"文献情報・原文（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1287/orsc.2.1.71"}],"note":"探索と活用の配分を扱うモデル。"}},{"id":"kb_165","title":"チキンゲーム","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Thomas C. Schelling（参照著作の著者）","works":["The Strategy of Conflict (1960). Harvard University Press"],"sources":[{"title":"原著のデジタル書誌・プレビュー","url":"https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Strategy_of_Conflict.html?id=fkxixT_A7_UC"}],"note":"危険を伴う競争と交渉を扱う代表的著作を関連文献として参照。チキンゲームの歴史上の最初の発案者をSchellingと断定しません。","period":"1960年（参照著作）"}},{"id":"kb_161","title":"調停理論","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Dean G. Pruitt / Kenneth Kressel（参照文献の著者）","works":["The Mediation of Social Conflict: An Introduction (1985). Journal of Social Issues, 41(2), 1-10"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-4560.1985.tb00851.x"}],"note":"Pruitt・Kressel本人による社会的紛争の調停の論文。調停は複数のモデルを含む分野で、単一の万能理論ではありません。","period":"1985年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_523","title":"沈黙の圧力","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Jared R. Curhan / Jennifer R. Overbeck / Yeri Cho / Teng Zhang / Yu Yang（関連文献の著者）","works":["Silence is golden: Extended silence, deliberative mindset, and value creation in negotiation. (2022). Journal of Applied Psychology, 107(1), 78-94"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1037/apl0000877"}],"note":"交渉中の延長された沈黙を扱う原著。ただし研究は沈黙による熟慮・価値創出を検討しており、「相手が気まずさで必ず譲歩する」という説明を直接保証するものではありません。","period":"2022年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_160","title":"デエスカレーション","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Janet Richmond / Jon Berlin / Avrim Fishkind / Garland Holloman / Scott Zeller / Michael Wilson / Muhamad Aly Rifai / Anthony Ng（関連文献の著者）","works":["Verbal De-escalation of the Agitated Patient: Consensus Statement of the American Association for Emergency Psychiatry Project BETA De-escalation Workgroup (2012). Western Journal of Emergency Medicine, 13(1), 17-25"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.5811/westjem.2011.9.6864"}],"note":"救急精神医療における言語的デエスカレーションの合意文書。日常の紛争全般への説明は応用で、臨床の手順をそのまま自己実践するための案内ではありません。","period":"2012年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_548","title":"適応的計画","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Ken Schwaber / Jeff Sutherland（関連文献の著者）","works":["The Scrum Guide (2020)"],"sources":[{"title":"著者・出版社による原著・書誌情報","url":"https://scrumguides.org/scrum-guide.html"}],"note":"反復・検査・適応を用いた開発の一次ガイドを参照。一般の計画・開発すべてをScrumと同一視しません。","period":"2020年（参照版）"}},{"id":"kb_522","title":"統合型交渉","provenance":{"status":"一部確認","attribution":"Roger Fisher / William Ury / Bruce Patton（関連文献の著者）","works":["Getting to Yes, revised edition (2011)"],"sources":[{"title":"著者・出版社による原著・書誌情報","url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/324551/getting-to-yes-by-roger-fisher-and-william-ury/9781101539545/"}],"note":"立場ではなく利益に注目し、相互利益の選択肢を探す著者の交渉書を参照。統合型交渉・パッケージ・論点交換の唯一の初出とは断定しません。","period":"2011年（参照版）"}},{"id":"kb_157","title":"トーマス＝キルマン・モデル","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"Kenneth W. Thomas / Ralph H. Kilmann（参照文献の著者）","works":["Thomas-Kilmann Conflict Mode Instrument (1974)"],"sources":[{"title":"著者・出版社による原著・書誌情報","url":"https://kilmanndiagnostics.com/a-brief-history-of-the-thomas-kilmann-conflict-mode-instrument/"}],"note":"共同開発者本人が1974年の正式公開と五つの対立対応を解説。テスト問題そのものは転載していません。","period":"1974年（参照版）"}},{"id":"kb_790","title":"ナッシュ均衡","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"John F. Nash Jr.","period":"1950年","works":["Equilibrium points in n-person games (1950)"],"sources":[{"title":"代表研究（DOI）","url":"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.36.1.48"}],"note":"均衡予測にはプレイヤー、情報、利得のモデル化が必要である。"}},{"id":"kb_156","title":"二重関心理論","provenance":{"status":"書誌確認済み","attribution":"DEAN G. PRUITT（参照文献の著者）","works":["Strategic Choice in Negotiation (1983). American Behavioral Scientist, 27(2), 167-194"],"sources":[{"title":"出版社登録の原著書誌・DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/000276483027002005"}],"note":"Pruitt本人による交渉方略と二重関心モデルを扱う論文。自己と他者への関心を二軸として扱います。","period":"1983年（参照文献）"}},{"id":"kb_783","title":"ネットワーク効果","pr